Legato 1.0.2's Service.qml and Model.js, exactly as released (git show ce22e65:...),
for tests/qml/service.qml: Omarchy keeps this service running through the update to 1.1
(its manifest said keepLoaded) until the shell restarts. On Quickshell 0.3.2 it runs under
1.0's own panel (compiled QML is kept through a reload); tests/qml/service.qml runs it under
the 1.1 panel, as a shell that cleared its component cache on a reload would.
Never edit these: they stand for what users have installed.
